---
/**
 * The hero's hidden slash.
 *
 * A fixed diagonal band carrying the repeated wordmark, painted into a
 * canvas and then masked to nothing. Moving the pointer paints into the mask,
 * so the band is discovered locally rather than shown: the artwork never
 * moves, only the brush does.
 *
 * Decorative and inert. The wordmark is already the hero's h1, so repeating
 * it here for a screen reader would only read the name a dozen more times.
 */
---

<div class="hero-fx" data-hero-slash aria-hidden="true">
  <canvas class="hero-fx-canvas" data-hero-slash-canvas></canvas>
</div>
